/URI (https://www.overleaf.com/docs?engine=pdflatex&snip_name=Example+to+create+a+new+paragraph&snip=%5Cdocumentclass%7Barticle%7D%0A%5Cbegin%7Bdocument%7D%0A%0A%5Cbegin%7Babstract%7D%0AThis+is+a+simple+paragraph+at+the+beginning+of+the+%0Adocument.+A+brief+introduction+about+the+main+subject.%0A%5Cend%7Babstract%7D%0A%0AAfter+our+abstract+we+can+begin+the+first+paragraph%2C+then+press+%60%60enter%27%27+twice+to+start+the+second+one.%0A%0AThis+line+will+start+a+second+paragraph.%0A%0AI+will+start+the+third+paragraph+and+then+add+%5C%5C+a+manual+line+break+which+causes+this+text+to+start+on+a+new+line+but+remains+part+of+the+same+paragraph.+Alternatively%2C+I+can+use+the+%5Cverb%7C%5Cnewline%7C%5Cnewline+command+to+start+a+new+line%2C+which+is+also+part+of+the+same+paragraph.%0A%5Cend%7Bdocument%7D)>>
